46666 sats | ≈0.049233 ETH | $0.36 |\n| 7 | arb1: swap WBTC → USDC | 246666 sats | ≈147.70 USDC | $0.36 |\n\n- **Total cost:** $10.2208. Your limit is $15 and slippage is capped at 0.5%.\n- **ETH left on eth1:** about 0.0465 after the swap, the two fee transfers and the fees for its 5 transactions.\n- **Fee reserves:** each destination wallet keeps roughly 0.0008 ETH, enough for about 40 more transactions there.\n- **Timing:** quotes expire 5 minutes after they were issued. If they lapse before I start, I'll get new ones. If a new price differs from this plan, I'll check with you before going ahead.\n\nReply **approve** to run it, **reject** to cancel, or give me a cost cap."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":21,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":22,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_8"},"id":"toolu_01NJmuk67iQY1Pt47KSdxTyr"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":23,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_9\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01NJmuk67iQY1Pt47KSdxTyr","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":24,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_9"},"id":"toolu_01FeWqqVJDm8bYzW6r4kGtRH"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":25,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01FeWqqVJDm8bYzW6r4kGtRH","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asset":"WBTC"},"id":"toolu_013gs1k8FSxw33s1RMS58Qoj"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":27,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"495000\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_013gs1k8FSxw33s1RMS58Qoj","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","isError":false}]},{"ro